[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5139823867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5139823867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5139823867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMlt8-w","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-31T06:00:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T06:00:50Z","body":"> There's a space left where the `[resource]` tag is meant to be (which is why tests are failing, I assume), when there's no metadata. Also, it seems like the subresources don't get saved with an error of `Resource was not pre cached for the resource section, bug?` Otherwise it looks good. Could be a good foundation for fixing #101287 as well.\r\n\r\nI have plans to fix #101287 but in a future PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5139823867/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5171889586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5171889586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5171889586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNETFsg","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-03T21:23:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T21:23:29Z","body":"> Seems fine overall, however embedding a PackedScene makes the parent scene unable to load. To reproduce: export a PackedScene variable, pack some node and put the scene into the variable. It seems to be correctly saved in the scene:\r\n> <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"770\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/2223172/630717958-e77f03df-6035-4256-aa4b-028ee21496f3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..afVLMUJ8xCb4dVNXs5iAAOpFt7QJybTQcO8L8NZ_aP8\">\r\n> \r\n> but as you can see, the root nodes of the scenes are mixed up. Adding `[resource]` tag in between (even empty) fixes this.\r\n\r\nJust to double check, create a script with `@export var scene: PackedScene` in a *node*, correct?\r\nAnd then create a scene, pack the scene, then save?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5171889586/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5171992643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5171992643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5171992643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNEZYQw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-03T21:35:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T21:35:48Z","body":"Yeah, the nested PackedScene needs to be part of another scene. It can be in a Node or a sub-resource of a node.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5171992643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5255488071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5255488071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5255488071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOUBiRw","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T15:50:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T15:50:12Z","body":"I have absolutely no clue why or how the PR got closed, my bad.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5255488071/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444153539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5444153539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5444153539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRH8www","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T19:23:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T19:23:41Z","body":"There's a quirk that I'm not sure if it's from some caching issue already present in the engine or not: if you save the metadata in a scene, then open and save it in the editor on the same session, the metadata will disappear.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444153539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5445434060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5445434060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5445434060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRJK6zA","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T21:28:01Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T21:31:53Z","body":"> There's a quirk that I'm not sure if it's from some caching issue already present in the engine or not: if you save the metadata in a scene, then open and save it in the editor on the same session, the metadata will disappear.\r\n\r\nYes, I know it's even in the body of the PR.\r\n\r\nProper editor support would be in another PR. The editor can already support editing metadata even stable if you do something like this:\r\n<img width=\"441\" height=\"288\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad984064-8c15-4540-aaa5-00c02f04b7b1\" />\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[gd_scene format=3 uid=\"uid://d324fweboaq7f\"]\r\n\r\n[sub_resource type=\"GDScript\" id=\"GDScript_juxxu\"]\r\nresource_name = \"holder\"\r\nscript/source = \"extends Node\r\n\r\n@export var inner_scene: PackedScene\"\r\n\r\n[sub_resource type=\"PackedScene\" id=\"PackedScene_ig7tw\"]\r\n_bundled = {\"names\": [\"Root\", \"Node\", \"GuessWhereThisNodeIsComingFrom\", \"Node\", \"AdditionalNode\", \"Node\"], \"variants\": [], \"node_count\": 3, \"nodes\": [-1, -1, 1, 0, -1, 0, 0, 1073741824, 0, 3, 2, -1, 0, 0, 1073741825, 0, 5, 4, -1, 0, 0], \"node_ids\": [902498397, 1818361507, 380747958], \"conn_count\": 0, \"conns\": [],\"node_paths\": [\".\", \".\"], \"id_paths\": [[], []], \"editable_instances\": [], \"version\": 3}\r\nmetadata/glorious_metadata = \"indeed\"\r\nresource_name = \"I even have a name\"\r\n\r\n[node name=\"Root\" unique_id=902498397 instance=SubResource(\"PackedScene_ig7tw\")]\r\n\r\n[node name=\"Holder\" type=\"Node\" parent=\".\" unique_id=495676997]\r\nscript = SubResource(\"GDScript_juxxu\")\r\ninner_scene = SubResource(\"PackedScene_ig7tw\")\r\n```\r\nYou can open this one in stable without my PR, I am very proud of finding this one out.\r\n\r\nGuess what the engine is doing here.\r\n\r\nI am at the end of the day just improving the user experience from features we already have :upside_down_face:\r\n(Yes I know doing this is not intended, but it's fun none the less)\r\n\r\nAnd yes, I already tested with classes inherited from packed scene, even custom exported properties work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5445434060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5445638641","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5445638641","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5445638641,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRJXZ8Q","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T21:50:44Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T21:50:44Z","body":"> Yes, I know it's even in the body of the PR.\r\n\r\nIt indeed is. I must've glanced over it, my bad.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5445638641/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5455388529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121920#issuecomment-5455388529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121920","id":5455388529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRSqfcQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T17:02:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T17:02:33Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5455388529/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]